Comment:
 uspiflash writes C headers containing data (chip ids, sizes, geometry, supply
 voltages, capabilities and supported commands) drawn from the spiflash
 Python package's database (Apache-2.0), itself extracted by spiflash from
 the upstreams listed in spiflash's own debian/copyright
 (https://github.com/mithro/spiflash/blob/main/debian/copyright). No code
 from those upstreams, or from spiflash itself, is included here.

